bob-cli-1l.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-1l[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Restore Bob Obsidian Sync and establish a sub-1 GB footprint policy[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Obsidian Sync completes end to end on athena and the MacBook from a[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]fully reconciled, backed-up vault whose charged storage is below [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the Standard plan's 1 GB limit, with explicit and repeatable [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]decisions about every excluded or unsupported content class.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]restore_obsidian_sync.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/restore_obsidian_sync.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-1l[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-1l/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reconcile live, local, remote-only, and historical storage[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]audit[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]audit: produce a read-only, cross-device inventory that distinguishes [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]live bytes, stranded remote entries, pending uploads, and charged [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]version history.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Preserve every copy and approve the new sync policy[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]protect[dim] · [dim][/dim]after audit[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]protect: capture independent snapshots, reconcile divergent device [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]state, and obtain explicit approval for the rebuild and optional [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exclusions.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rebuild the remote vault with exclusions preconfigured[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]recover[dim] · [dim][/dim]after protect[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]recover: replace the history-bloated remote vault, seed it from the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reconciled tree, and reconnect each device without uploading excluded [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]content.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prove quota headroom, round trips, and data completeness[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after recover[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify: demonstrate green sync cycles, cross-device round trips, a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sub-limit storage reading, and manifest-level preservation.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Record the footprint policy and operational audit[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]document[dim] · [dim][/dim]after verify[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]document: update the runbook with measured recommendations, the rebuild [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]procedure, and a reproducible redacted footprint audit.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-1l","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-1l.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-8c378c648668e62dc933185daebb8697","started_at":"2026-08-27T13:57:37.499606+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"f4b6a9496b0322d79d450e3521b5e43ce1f550b6888f503d3fab5eaf69830610","